      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    initial_units = 200000\n    new_units = 220000\n    price_per_unit = 250\n    variable_cost_per_unit = 65\n    fixed_operating_costs = 10000000\n\n    # Calculate operating income at each output level\n    contribution_margin_per_unit = price_per_unit - variable_cost_per_unit\n    initial_operating_income = (\n        initial_units * contribution_margin_per_unit - fixed_operating_costs\n    )\n    new_operating_income = (\n        new_units * contribution_margin_per_unit - fixed_operating_costs\n    )\n\n    # Calculate the percentage change in operating income\n    percentage_change = (\n        (new_operating_income - initial_operating_income)\n        / initial_operating_income\n        * 100\n    )\n    answer = round(percentage_change, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
